      "node_id": "kg_doc_6",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Any Questions for Ben? is a 2012 Australian comedy film created by Working Dog Productions, directed by Rob Sitch. It stars Josh Lawson, Rachael Taylor, Felicity Ward, Daniel Henshall and Christian Clark. It was written by Santo Cilauro, Tom Gleisner and Rob Sitch.",
